UID:f1a33fa82b3741b6@neighbourhood-events
DTSTAMP:20261001T154140Z
DTSTART:20261206T140000Z
DTEND:20261206T160000Z
SUMMARY:ERASMUS PLEADS FOR PEACE
LOCATION:Het Goudblommeke in Papier
URL:https://goudblommekeinpapier.be/event/erasmus-smeekt-om-vrede/
DESCRIPTION:a tale by Frank Jacobs and Chris Reunes. What would peace tel
 l us if she were a woman of flesh and blood? How would she convince us t
 o stop war and violence? Erasmus asked himself this question back in 151
 7 because the world was on fire then too. He wrote THE LAMENTATION OF PE
 ACE\, a text that has remained meaningful\, especially today. Frank JACO
 BS and Chris REUNES present to you THE LAMENTATION OF PEACE\, with text 
 excerpts\, commentary and image projection. They also bring satirical di
 alogues in which Erasmus dismisses all violence as crime with razor-shar
